# 逐次キューの構成（正本: books/quickscribe-design/background-jobs.md）
direction: down

stop: 録音停止
enqueue: "enqueue\nqueued"
gate: "running が居るか" { shape: diamond }
wait: 待機のまま
run: "mark_running\nrunning は常に1件" { style.bold: true }
done: done
err: error

stop -> enqueue -> gate
gate -> wait: 居る
gate -> run: 居ない
run -> done
run -> err
